102	     * present, plus {@code 1} when the owner has no namesakes (namesakeCount is 0), plus {@code 2}
103	     * when the owner belongs to a household of {@value #HOUSEHOLD_POINTS_THRESHOLD} or more, plus
104	     * {@code 3} when the owner's tenure exceeds {@value #TENURE_POINTS_THRESHOLD_DAYS} days.
